DOMAIN: The Revisionism Debate and Orthodoxy versus Reformism
SEARCH_DATE: 2026-06-10
PAPERS_FOUND: 11 total (High: 5, Medium: 5, Low: 1)
SEARCH_SOURCES: SEP, PhilPapers, Semantic Scholar, OpenAlex, CORE, CrossRef
