  booktitle = {On the Formation of Marxism},
  year      = {2016},
  pages     = {35--56},
  publisher = {BRILL},
  doi       = {10.1163/9789004306653_004},
  note      = {
  CORE ARGUMENT: This chapter reconstructs the 1899 revisionist controversy
  as a confrontation between Bernstein's empirical critique of the
  Zusammenbruchstheorie (breakdown of capitalism) and Kautsky's defence of
  Marxist scientific socialism. Gronow shows that Bernstein targeted above all
