  note = {
  CORE ARGUMENT: Intellectual biography covering Kautsky's formative years
  through the First World War, emphasizing his role as the systematizer of
  orthodox Marxism and guardian of Marxist theoretical continuity. Steenson
  argues that Kautsky's synthesis of Darwinian naturalism and Marxist
